# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as [, value]}
	<p>{value}</p>
{/each}

{#each animals as [key, , value]}
	<p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}

{#each animals as [key, value]}
	<p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}

```


# Formatted

```svelte
{#each animals as [, value]}
	<p>{value}</p>
{/each}

{#each animals as [key, , value]}
	<p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}

{#each animals as [key, value]}
	<p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}

```
